# 029 - + is Int+Int or Str+Str; a mixed pair is a Type error (§2). There is no
# "add a number to a string" coercion in either direction, so the operand types
# appear in the message in source order.
--- source
print "a" + 1;
--- expect
error: Type at line 1: + expects Int or Str operands, got Str and Int
